# A news [[#Noun|reporter]]; a [[journalist]].

=====Usage notes=====
* The word is much less frequent in [[Quebec]], where it is seen as an [[anglicism]], words like {{m|fr|journaliste}}, {{m|fr|correspondant}} or {{m|fr|envoyé}} are preferred.

